      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:13rzbe'
    female|a||And that single weight, 0.6, stands in for everyone in the state, whatever a particular person would say about their own wheelchair.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 8360
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:jdxbz5'
    female|a|soft|In 1980, Pliskin, Shepard and Weinstein wrote down exactly which conditions your preferences must satisfy for these sums to be a valid utility measure — constant proportional trade-off among them.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 14080
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:14uhb7x'
    female|a||Which makes it testable. So do real people trade the way the formula says?:
      mp3: 
      ms: 6400
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:m5z3ic'
    'female|a||Constant proportional trade-off predicts this flat line: the same share of remaining life surrendered, whatever the duration.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7800
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1fnx8mt'
    female|a||Time trade-off studies keep finding this instead — over a short horizon people will barely trade at all, and the share grows as the horizon lengthens.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 8840
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1ruxp3x'
    female|a||Where the lines part, the assumption is failing — and it fails hardest for short horizons, exactly where a drug like nusinersen is judged.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 9120
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:kmcjcl'
    female|a||In the very worst states some people answer that more time is worse than less — something the multiplication cannot express at all.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 8320
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:139kytl'
    'female|a|grave|So: would you take that trade? Most people, asked directly, will not — which is why the QALY is not a discovery about you, but a convention, with its assumptions written down where they can be argued with.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 17160
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:89qr2f'
    'female|a||Nusinersen''s effect in spinal muscular atrophy arrives as a list: milestones reached, months off a ventilator, a child sitting unsupported at two.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10840
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:8cvfwy'
    'female|a||A hip replacement arrives as a different list: four points less pain, three hundred metres more walking, back at work by spring.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8160
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:fuzsg4'
    female|a||Now subtract one list from the other — there is no operation that does it, because the two share no unit.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 7800
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:rcimsp'
    female|a|grave|Yet one budget must choose between them, and without a shared unit the choice falls to whoever argues most persuasively in the room.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 11840
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:wmw3df'
    'female|a||So we impose a unit: every outcome in either list is re-expressed as utility multiplied by time.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9400
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:82atei'
    female|a||Three quality-adjusted life years for the child; about one and a half for the hip, on illustrative round numbers.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 7240
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:ty8oa3'
    female|a||Their incremental costs, delta C, differ by nearly two orders of magnitude.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 5920
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:kaet1z'
    'female|a||Divide cost by effect and each becomes a price per QALY: two million kroner against sixty thousand.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8880
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:2gu7lz'
    female|a||Read it the other way round — the same million kroner buys half a healthy year here, and seventeen there.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 7040
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:j3rd6i'
    'female|a||That is opportunity cost made visible: the patients you never meet, finally on the same page as the ones you do.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8800
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:jn9jr2'
    female|a||This is what the common currency buys us — nytte, benefit, made comparable across diseases that have nothing else in common.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 9760
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1xi1skr'
    female|a||But a currency charges its own exchange fee.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 3640
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:mpougj'
    'female|a||The number cannot say who gained: three QALYs for an infant and three for a pensioner are the same three.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7440
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:10vokqb'
    female|a||It cannot say how bad they were to begin with — alvorlighet, severity, has to be added back afterwards as a separate criterion, which is why nusinersen was first refused and later accepted with an age limit rather than by its ICER alone.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 16680
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:wwjf2'
    female|a||And it cannot say whose values fixed u in the first place, which is exactly where we go next.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 6400
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1pnlvu0'
    'female|a|grave|Across these four parts: ten years in a wheelchair became a utility, utility times time became a QALY, the multiplication hid a trade you might not accept for yourself — and this one number is what lets a health system see everyone it could have helped instead.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 21480
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:5h2md7'
    'female|a||Build that number for a real decision, one Beslutningsforum actually had to make: nusinersen for spinal muscular atrophy.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8560
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical'
    female|a||Look at what the multiplication itself quietly claims — because that claim is about you, and it decides which drugs Beslutningsforum buys.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 10600
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical'
    'female|a||Which leaves one question: why force everything into a single number at all?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5200
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical'
